{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Bodega Simulator is a short simulation game where you play as a recently laid off adventurer running a small shop. In this demo you'll be able to experience the first 6 days of the full game, with an &quot;endless&quot; mode so you can continue as long as you'd like.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035470/extras/017553ae0b5a72013c79706134cd2e91.avif?t=1758339174\" width=1400 height=276 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops and process them into items for adventurers!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell items customers and dungeon dwellers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/night cycle with different demands each day you can adapt to and make more gold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get dungeon slimes you can keep as pets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the start of some of the storylines from the main game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Style graphics</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4035470?t=1758339174","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4035470?t=1758339174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035470/ab752e4a88d51e459f49becde9c83e50f5957fe4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758339174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035470/ab752e4a88d51e459f49becde9c83e50f5957fe4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758339174","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_par